id: giant-form-super-giant-form
name: Super Giant Form
order: 4
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
description: >
  You are extremely adept at manipulating your size and making use of that increased bulk in combat.
text: >
  Super Giant Form: You are extremely adept at manipulating your size and making use of that increased bulk in combat.
  (1)-[Permanent]: You gain access to the 4th Grade of Giant Form.
  (2)-[Passive]: The Growth Aspect for Giant Form can reach up to 4 levels.
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase your Damage Reduction by 1/2 (rounded up) of G(T).
  (4)-[Passive]: Double the bonus from the 1st effect of Accelerated Growth.
  (5)-[Passive]: The 1st effect of Battlefield Titan loses its [1/Round] Keyword.

